61fbe794-dad2-4b90-ba71-96d55a415d30	authentik default Kerberos User Mapping: Ignore system principals	localpart, realm = principal.rsplit("@", 1)\ndenied_prefixes = ["kadmin/", "krbtgt/", "K/M", "WELLKNOWN/", "kiprop/", "changepw/"]\nfor prefix in denied_prefixes:\n    if localpart.lower().startswith(prefix.lower()):\n        raise SkipObject\nreturn {}	goauthentik.io/sources/kerberos/user/default/ignore-system-principals
